WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.368 --> 00:00:02.951
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.124 --> 00:00:06.400
- I just don't understand,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.097
if you're the one who
overbooked the hotel,

00:00:08.097 --> 00:00:08.930
- This is crazy.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.980
- you usually accommodate the
people that you screwed over,

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:11.813
- Right?

00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:13.060
- by finding them places to stay, but no.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.950
- I just couldn't believe
it when you called me.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:15.970
I thought to myself--

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.102
- Happy Valentine's Day.

00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:18.935
Oh.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.450
Hey.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.283
- Babe?

00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:22.502
Uh.

00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:23.900
Hi.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.830
Oh my God.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.230
Wow.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.886
I didn't think we were
doing anything this year,

00:00:28.886 --> 00:00:29.719
for Valentine's.

00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:32.351
- We weren't, but I
thought I'd change it up.

00:00:32.351 --> 00:00:33.920
I don't know.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:34.790
- I know that.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.850
I just thought we had agreed
to take things at face value,

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:38.850
to not (stammering).

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.970
Sorry, this is Kate,

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:42.971
- Hey.

00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:43.804
- Hey.

00:00:43.804 --> 00:00:44.637
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:44.637 --> 00:00:45.470
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.646
- from college.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:47.479
- Oh yeah.

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:48.312
- Kate had some travel mishaps.

00:00:48.312 --> 00:00:49.720
- They overbooked my hotel.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.840
It was this whole thing.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.210
- So I said she could stay here tonight.

00:00:54.271 --> 00:00:55.420
- Yeah.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.230
- 'Cause this is what we
talked about, beforehand.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.610
- We talked about Kate staying over?

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:01.460
- Yeah, I mean, doing nothing.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.667
Not doing anything tonight.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:03.500
- Right.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.210
Not doing anything is the
same as having your friend

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.560
stay the night over, right?

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.413
- Listen.

00:01:10.413 --> 00:01:11.781
Hey, you guys are doing something.

00:01:11.781 --> 00:01:14.330
I think I could get one
of those pod chairs.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:15.680
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.496
- I'm sure pod chairs
are super open right now.

00:01:17.496 --> 00:01:18.479
- It's just another day.

00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:19.749
I'll cancel all my plans.

00:01:19.749 --> 00:01:20.582
I don't care.

00:01:20.582 --> 00:01:21.415
- I think it would be better if I just--

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:23.060
- No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:23.893
You're staying.

00:01:23.893 --> 00:01:25.430
Please.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.070
I insist.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:28.428
- You're staying.

00:01:28.428 --> 00:01:29.820
- Come on.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:30.925
Okay.

00:01:30.925 --> 00:01:32.100
So you definitely can
add a third wheel to our,

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.210
a third party to our reservation?

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.257
I know it's Valentine's
Day (chuckling), but,

00:01:36.257 --> 00:01:38.870
I'd be laughing too if
I were you honestly.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.570
Cancellation fee?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:44.430
Even if I don't eat I
still have to pay $250?

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.263
Well, I,

00:01:45.263 --> 00:01:46.490
Look, I'm not gonna
shoot the messenger here,

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:47.730
I mean, that's a fair price.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.330
Alright, well, thank you anyway.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:52.330
- So babe, what'd they have to say?

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:53.980
- It's lookin' like it's
gonna be a little tough

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.000
to squeeze in a third.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.300
- Did you talk to, did
you talk to the manager?

00:01:58.248 --> 00:02:01.510
- Why don't you two go together?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:02.680
- Oh, no, um.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.586
- We cannot let this
reservation go to waste.

00:02:04.586 --> 00:02:05.419
- Well, I don't--

00:02:05.419 --> 00:02:06.546
- This is like a once in a lifetime meal.

00:02:06.546 --> 00:02:07.379
- Why don't?

00:02:07.379 --> 00:02:08.424
You know, you know,

00:02:08.424 --> 00:02:09.479
you've been so excited
about this restaurant.

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:10.312
- You two.

00:02:10.312 --> 00:02:11.341
Girls night out.

00:02:11.341 --> 00:02:12.174
While I sit here alone on Valentine's Day.

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:13.108
- My shoes are already off.

00:02:13.108 --> 00:02:14.077
- You know what?

00:02:14.077 --> 00:02:14.924
(clear throat)

00:02:14.924 --> 00:02:15.757
I'm actually pretty tired,

00:02:15.757 --> 00:02:16.777
and I have to work early in the morning,

00:02:16.777 --> 00:02:18.063
so I'm just gonna turn in.

00:02:18.063 --> 00:02:18.896
I'm just gonna.

00:02:18.896 --> 00:02:19.978
(fingers snapping)

00:02:19.978 --> 00:02:20.811
- She's tired.

00:02:20.811 --> 00:02:21.644
- Tired?

00:02:21.644 --> 00:02:22.477
- Yeah.

00:02:22.477 --> 00:02:23.310
- Alright.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.541
Let's get you tucked in.

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:25.374
Come on Ben.

00:02:25.374 --> 00:02:26.565
How could I have not predicted
you were gonna have a friend

00:02:26.565 --> 00:02:27.707
in town on Valentine's night?

00:02:27.707 --> 00:02:28.540
- Babe, can I help you?

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.472
- No, I got this.

00:02:29.472 --> 00:02:30.305
- Are you sure?

00:02:30.305 --> 00:02:31.138
- No.

00:02:31.138 --> 00:02:31.971
This is my mess.

00:02:31.971 --> 00:02:32.804
I'm gonna live in it.

00:02:32.804 --> 00:02:33.637
I'm gonna clean it.

00:02:33.637 --> 00:02:34.470
- Ha ha.

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:35.303
- I'm gonna fold it.

00:02:35.303 --> 00:02:36.228
- I think I'm gonna run
down to Waffle House,

00:02:36.228 --> 00:02:37.061
and just hang out there for a little bit.

00:02:37.061 --> 00:02:37.894
- Waffle House?

00:02:37.894 --> 00:02:38.727
- I'll be back in like in a good--

00:02:38.727 --> 00:02:39.568
- What are you, hungry?

00:02:39.568 --> 00:02:40.535
I'll set you up with some food.

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:41.368
Come on.

00:02:41.368 --> 00:02:42.267
We got food here.

00:02:42.267 --> 00:02:43.100
Let's go.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:43.934
- I'm, it's less,

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:45.092
(whimsical music)

00:02:45.092 --> 00:02:45.925
(laughs nervously)

00:02:45.925 --> 00:02:46.758
- Wow.

00:02:46.758 --> 00:02:48.080
You know, If I had known we
had guests coming over tonight,

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.930
I probably would have done a
little bit of grocery shoppin',

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.814
'cause we got nada.

00:02:51.814 --> 00:02:52.647
- Babe.

00:02:52.647 --> 00:02:53.480
- Yogurt?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.317
- Babe.

00:02:54.317 --> 00:02:55.150
Babe.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.025
- Looks like we got medium egg noodles,

00:02:56.025 --> 00:02:56.858
- Babe.

00:02:56.858 --> 00:02:57.691
- for dinner.

00:02:57.691 --> 00:02:58.524
You like egg noodles?

00:02:58.524 --> 00:02:59.373
We got peanut butter.

00:02:59.373 --> 00:03:00.341
- Babe, why don't I.

00:03:00.341 --> 00:03:01.196
Can I help you get in there?

00:03:01.196 --> 00:03:02.029
- So hey, you took your shoes off.

00:03:02.029 --> 00:03:03.125
You're off duty for the rest of the night.

00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:03.958
- You know?

00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:04.791
- They put peanut sauce on Thai stuff.

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:05.749
We'll do a little Pad Thai.

00:03:05.749 --> 00:03:06.582
- You know what?

00:03:06.582 --> 00:03:07.415
I'm just gonna hop in.

00:03:07.415 --> 00:03:08.248
I'm just gonna hop in.

00:03:08.248 --> 00:03:09.081
- Maybe put some yogurt too.

00:03:09.081 --> 00:03:09.914
Get a little creamy al dente.

00:03:09.914 --> 00:03:10.747
- I'm just gonna hop in.

00:03:10.747 --> 00:03:11.580
- Hey!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:12.413
- All this nonsense that's on the floor,

00:03:12.413 --> 00:03:13.246
that nobody really asked for.

00:03:13.246 --> 00:03:14.079
- You like carrots?

00:03:14.079 --> 00:03:14.912
- Behind you.

00:03:14.912 --> 00:03:15.745
Okay.

00:03:15.745 --> 00:03:16.578
- Valentine's Day tradition.

00:03:16.578 --> 00:03:17.411
Us three.

00:03:17.411 --> 00:03:18.244
Get together every year.

00:03:18.244 --> 00:03:19.077
- Yeah.

00:03:19.077 --> 00:03:19.910
- I am actually happier
eating here right now.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:20.743
- Me too, actually.

00:03:20.743 --> 00:03:21.576
Me too.

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:22.409
- You know what I like?

00:03:22.409 --> 00:03:23.242
Fine, nice thin cut shichimi.

00:03:23.242 --> 00:03:24.075
- Hm.

00:03:24.075 --> 00:03:25.542
- Probably the best
Valentine's Day I've ever had.

00:03:25.542 --> 00:03:26.480
(spraying can)

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.313
- Ahh!

00:03:27.313 --> 00:03:28.146
- Ow!

00:03:28.146 --> 00:03:28.979
- Oh my God!

00:03:28.979 --> 00:03:29.812
I got bleach in my eye!

00:03:29.812 --> 00:03:30.645
- Oh, I really cut deep here, you guys--

00:03:30.645 --> 00:03:31.478
- I can't believe.

00:03:31.478 --> 00:03:32.311
Fuck.

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:33.144
- Guys!

00:03:33.144 --> 00:03:33.977
Guys!

00:03:33.977 --> 00:03:34.810
Look at yourselves.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.230
This is 100 % the most
dysfunctional relationship

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.410
I've ever seen in my life.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.600
This is hard to watch.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.770
You guys just should,

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:42.603
this is,

00:03:42.603 --> 00:03:43.436
unhealthy.

00:03:43.436 --> 00:03:44.440
You should not be together.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.580
Look at you.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.934
- I am so sorry.

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:53.767
- No. It's,

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:54.700
- I'm sorry that we,

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.330
I mean we open our house to you,

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.730
on Valentine's Day, and

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.040
- We let you into our house.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.186
- We were cooking you a
meal on Valentine's Day.

00:04:02.186 --> 00:04:03.023
- What?

00:04:03.023 --> 00:04:03.856
You're gonna tell us how
to live our relationship.

00:04:03.856 --> 00:04:06.240
Says the girl who's
single on Valentine's Day.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.125
- Poor Ben was trying to find you--

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:07.958
The nerve.

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:09.000
- Kate, I haven't seen you in years.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.282
- I gotta go.

00:04:10.282 --> 00:04:11.230
- What's this?

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.172
I gotta.

00:04:12.172 --> 00:04:13.081
- You gotta go.

00:04:13.081 --> 00:04:13.914
- Alright.

00:04:13.914 --> 00:04:16.439
- Yeah, have fun out there.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.272
(door closes)

00:04:17.272 --> 00:04:18.610
God, we're lucky.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.443
- Yeah.

00:04:19.443 --> 00:04:20.328
You got that right.

00:04:20.328 --> 00:04:21.161
- Hmm.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.450
- I love you.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.080
- I love you too.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.320
Happy Valentine's Day.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.520
- Happy Valentine's Day.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.123
- I need to go to the hospital.

00:04:32.123 --> 00:04:34.706
(upbeat music)

